            "displayName": "Jukka Zitting",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "You marked this as occurring in 1.1? If correct, then it shouldn't be caused by JCR-546, since it's not included in either 1.1 or 1.1.1.",
